Dialogue: 0,2:14:27.50,2:14:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,《饥饿游戏》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在叛国罪的条款中:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the Treaty of the Treason:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.05,0:00:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了给13区起义行为赎罪 每个地区每年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In penance for their uprising,each district shall offer up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.05,0:00:47.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都要公开"招募"在12-18岁的少年男女作为贡者斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a male and female between the ages of 12 and 18 at a public "reaping".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些贡者斗士被送到国会大厦监管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These Tributes shall be delivered to the custody of the Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.05,0:00:55.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后送到角斗场 他们将在那里战斗至死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then transferred to a public arena where they will Fight to the Death,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.09,0:00:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到剩下最后一个胜利者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until a lone victor remains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.05,0:01:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从今往后 直到永远 这个盛会都会被称为饥饿游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Henceforth and forevermore this pageant shall be known as The Hunger Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想 这是我们的传统…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think its our tradition...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.76,0:01:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它来自于…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It comes out of a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.20,0:01:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们历史上特别痛苦的那一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}particularly painful part of our history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.44,0:01:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但它已经变成我们能够治愈这个痛苦的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's been a way we've been able to heal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.34,0:01:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起初 它只是叛乱的一个幸存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At first it was a remainder of the rebellion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它是这个区必须付出的代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the price the Districts had to pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.43,0:01:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我认为它会由此成熟起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I think it has grown from that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得它是一个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think its a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.47,0:01:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它把我们联系在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its something that nets us all together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.94,0:01:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的第三个年头的比赛吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your third year's game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.76,0:01:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您的个人签名是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What defines your personal signature?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.85,0:01:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘘 没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shhhh. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.78,0:01:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 你只是在做梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. You're just dreaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.09,0:01:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你正在做梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're dreaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.77,0:01:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.88,0:01:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道它像什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what its like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.13,0:01:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的第一次招募 普里姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your first, Prim,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.35,0:01:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的名字只在他们那里出现一次 他们是不会选中你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your name's gonna be there once, they're not gonna pick you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.37,0:01:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,睡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to go to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.40,0:01:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.55,0:01:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试试吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.14,0:02:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试试吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.73,0:02:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在草地深处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deep in the meadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.16,0:02:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在柳树下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under the willow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.90,0:02:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在草丛中单脚跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hop in the grass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.52,0:02:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个柔软的绿枕头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A soft green pillow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.57,0:02:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得那首歌吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember that song?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.06,0:02:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把它唱完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You finish it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.79,0:02:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.83,0:02:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.58,0:02:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我会回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'll be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.99,0:02:52.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是要把你烹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll still cook you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了它后会怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you gonna do with that when you kill it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.89,0:05:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这该死的 盖尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn you, Gale!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.53,0:05:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不好笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你对一头重达100磅的鹿能怎么办 凯特尼斯 ？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you gonna do with a 100 pound deer, Katnip?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是招募日 到处都充斥着维和保安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Reaping Day, the place is crawling with Peacekeepers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.15,0:05:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来要卖掉它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was gonna sell it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.81,0:05:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从维和保安…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from Peacekeepers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然你是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.30,0:05:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卖给你 不卖给维和保安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you don't sell the Peacekeepers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.77,0:05:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是今天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Not today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我一年里看到的第一个鹿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the first deer I've seen in a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 我什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I have nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.03,0:05:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.71,0:06:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们做了又能怎么样？只有你一个 为什么人们不停止观看呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if they did? Just one you. Why if everyone just stop watching?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不会的 盖尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They won't, Gale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.12,0:06:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们做了能怎么样？如果我们做了呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if they did? What if we did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.54,0:06:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.86,0:06:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你给你喜欢的选手加油 他们被杀掉 你就哭 太脆弱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You root for your favorite, you cry when they get killed. It's sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.35,0:06:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有人看…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If no one watches...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么他们就没有这个游戏了 就是这么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then they don't have a game. It's as simple as that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.61,0:06:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 笑…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine, laught at...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.74,0:06:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有笑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not laughing at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.22,0:06:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能做到这一点 你知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could do it, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.18,0:06:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离开 住在树林里 我们做什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take off. Live in the woods. What we do anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.59,0:06:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会抓住我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'd catch us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.44,0:06:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.57,0:06:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,切掉我们的舌头或者更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut out our tongues or worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会跑出五英里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We wouldn't make it five miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我已经走到5英里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I get five miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.13,0:07:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会走那条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll go that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.53,0:07:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有普里姆 你有你的弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have Prim. You have your brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.42,0:07:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们也可以来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can come too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,普里姆在树林里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prim in the woods?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.43,0:07:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我将不会有小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm never having kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不住在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I don't live here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 你就是住在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you do live here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.54,0:07:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 但如果我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, but if I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.99,0:07:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I forgot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.33,0:07:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.95,0:07:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.59,0:07:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.53,0:07:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 最好是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Better be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.79,0:07:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我用一只松鼠买的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cost me a squirrel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.49,0:07:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,饥饿游戏快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy Hunger Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.85,0:07:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望好运永远属于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And be the odds be ever in your favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.97,0:07:41.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的名字到今天用了多少次？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many times did your name in today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,42次？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forty-two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.82,0:07:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我不会那么好运正好被选中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess the odds aren't exactly in my favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.57,0:08:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.96,0:08:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.68,0:08:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一个…学舌鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a...Mocking Jay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.75,0:08:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多少钱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.92,0:08:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你拿着吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep it.{\r}
