Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.80,0:26:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样被杀死也挺不错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that's a good way to get killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.64,0:26:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好的办法被整死吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's a good way to get killed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.04,0:26:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 乔伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Joy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.57,0:26:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不加入我们呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you join us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.92,0:26:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说了能救命的建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just gaving a life-saving advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.98,0:26:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.16,0:26:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我…我只是问如何寻找避难所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wa...I was just asking about how to find shelter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.82,0:26:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果事实上你仍然活着 这将派上用场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which would come in handy if in fact you are still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.72,0:26:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你如何找到避难所？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you find shelter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.85,0:26:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把果酱给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pass the jam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.23,0:26:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你如何找到避难所？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you find shelter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.12,0:26:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我一个机会 醒醒吧 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a chance to wake up sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.81,0:26:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个指导是非常…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This mentoring is very...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.17,0:26:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,浪费税收和材料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tax and stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.97,0:26:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能把桔子酱递给我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you pass the marmalade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.12,0:26:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是红木的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is mahogany.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.56,0:26:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.69,0:27:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚杀掉了一块餐桌上的垫布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just killed a...place mat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.48,0:27:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的想知道如何生存？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really wanna know how to stay alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.95,0:27:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要让别人喜欢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get people to like you.{\r}
