Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.62,0:27:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是你期待的那些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not what you're expecting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.88,0:27:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当你在游戏中…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you're in the middle of the games...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.00,0:27:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在挨饿或挨冻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're starving or freezing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.69,0:27:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some water,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.01,0:27:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一把刀 甚至几根火柴都可能决定生死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a knife or even some matches can mean the difference between life and death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.16,0:27:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些东西只能从赞助商那里获得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And those things only comes from Sponsors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.36,0:27:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而要获得赞助商支持 你必须让人喜欢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to get Sponsors, you have to make people like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.83,0:27:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而现在 亲爱的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And right now, sweetheart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.62,0:27:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你离一个好开端并不远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not off to a really good start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.51,0:27:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它就在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.01,0:27:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它很大呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's huge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.03,0:27:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那真是难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.08,0:28:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.28,0:28:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.90,0:28:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最好带着这把刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better keep this knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.90,0:28:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他知道他在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows what he's doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.78,0:28:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 现在您已经看到了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now that you've seen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.53,0:28:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这几年科若佛部队怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what do you think of this years cropful troops?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.21,0:28:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今年会给我们带来什么惊喜吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are there any surprises that we can expect this year?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.53,0:28:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这真的很难从目前的招募中看出结果 但我觉得…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's really hard to tell from a Reaping but I think...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.49,0:28:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一个非常有趣的一群人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is a very interesting mix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.88,0:29:03.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些东西是你不能忽略的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's something you can't ignore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.37,0:29:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.31,0:29:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.08,0:29:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是说我们可能需要把你放倒用水管再冲一遍,\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were just saying we might need to hose you down again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.34,0:29:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我们带你见辛纳之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before we take you to Cinna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.13,0:29:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我见过的最勇敢的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was all the bravest thing I've ever seen.{\r}
