Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.58,0:29:52.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯特尼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.73,0:29:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很对不起 这事发生在你身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry that this happened to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.64,0:29:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里可以帮助你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm here to help you in any way I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.07,0:30:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大多数人都祝贺我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most people just congratulate me.{\r}
