Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.23,0:30:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 你在这里让我看起来漂亮点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're here to make me look pretty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.96,0:30:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来这里是为了帮助你给别人留下深刻印象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here to help you make an impression.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.38,0:30:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,通常 他们按照接近他们的区的服装打扮那些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now usually, they dress people in their close to their district.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.02,0:30:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我们被叫做未成年人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. We're called minors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.19,0:30:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 但我并不想这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. But I don't want to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.62,0:30:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要做一些会让他们记得住的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna do something that they're gonna remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.01,0:30:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们解释了关于争取获得赞助商帮助了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did they explain about trying to get sponsors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.63,0:30:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 但我并不是很善于交朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but I'm not very good at making friends.{\r}
