Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.34,0:30:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不应该被穿上一些愚蠢的服装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shouldn't be dressed up on some stupid costume as should they.{\r}
