Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.60,0:30:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是真正的火 这些套装搞成这样你就不会感觉到单调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not real fire. These suits are built so you won't feel a thing.{\r}
