Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.71,0:31:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超过十万人 张望着 为了看一眼今年的贡者斗士…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over one hundred thousand people, craning to get a glimpse this year's Tributes...{\r}
