Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.30,0:51:19.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种事情只有在这个时候发生 那就是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This kind of thing does happen at this point if there's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.98,0:51:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个赢家 对不对？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only one winner. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.89,0:51:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该有一些巧克力覆盖斯托克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should have some chocolate covered stoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.87,0:51:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们 先生们 您的司仪…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen. Your master of ceremonies...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.50,0:51:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒闪光人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar Flickerman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.38,0:51:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.19,0:51:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎 欢迎 欢迎 欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome, welcome, welcome, welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.71,0:51:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来到第74届饥饿游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the 74th Annual Hunger Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.29,0:52:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 还有五分钟 他们就都出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, there are five minutes they are all going to be out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.54,0:52:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有你听说过的贡者斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of the Tributes that you heard about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.46,0:52:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你高兴吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you excited?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.28,0:52:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我听吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me hear it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.37,0:52:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惊人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.47,0:52:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不觉得惊人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't feel amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.04,0:52:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道你不知道你是多么美丽？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you know how beautiful you look?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.71,0:52:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道如何让别人喜欢我 你是怎么让别人来喜欢你的呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. And I don't know how to make people like me, how do you make people like you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.30,0:52:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么让我喜欢你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you made me like you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.30,0:52:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是不同的 我并不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's different. I wasn't trying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.09,0:52:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.15,0:52:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要做回你自己 整个过程我都会在那里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just be yourself. I'll be there the whole time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.25,0:52:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假装你跟我说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and just pretend you're talking to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.56,0:52:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.25,0:52:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.13,0:52:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们来看看她是否真的闪亮光芒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see if she does indeed shine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.05,0:52:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们用热烈的掌声送给格力马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's have a warm round of applause for Glimmer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.15,0:52:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格力马 你准备好了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glimmer, are you prepared?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.06,0:52:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是凯撒 我准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes Caesar, I am prepared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.67,0:52:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢它 那只是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like it, that's just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.79,0:52:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一大圈的掌声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big round of applause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.62,0:52:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马布尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marvel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.62,0:53:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎克劳夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome Clove.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.42,0:53:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一种荣誉 能代表我的区出场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an honor to represent my district.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.80,0:53:05.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你是一个战士？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you're a fighter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.59,0:53:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我准备好了对付恶毒的东西 我要去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm prepared, vicious and I'm ready to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.11,0:53:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cato!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.00,0:53:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从12区来的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From District 12...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.93,0:53:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道她的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know her...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.13,0:53:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,作为燃烧的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as the girl on fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.79,0:53:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她就是凯特尼斯 伊芙迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where we know it's Katniss Everdeen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.70,0:54:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.29,0:54:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得某个人显得有点紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think someone's a little nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.23,0:54:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前几天 在贡者斗士游行的入口 我说过同样的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said that was quite and entrance that you've made at the Tribute's Parade the other day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.03,0:54:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要告诉我们吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to tell us about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.90,0:54:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我只是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I was just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.59,0:54:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望我不会把它烧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hoping that I wouldn't burned it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.03,0:54:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当你从那个战车上下来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you came out of that chariot...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.69,0:54:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不得不说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.13,0:54:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的心…停了下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My heart...stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.47,0:54:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也为了获得你的经验值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To earn you experiences as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.29,0:54:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的心脏停止跳动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My heart stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.45,0:54:56.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的心也停了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So did mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.44,0:55:01.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在告诉我关于火焰…他们是真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now tell me about the flames...are they real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.15,0:55:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.90,0:55:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 我今天正好穿着它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact I'm wearing them today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.55,0:55:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想看看吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.74,0:55:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等待 等待 等待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.47,0:55:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安全吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it safe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.31,0:55:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为大伙是怎么想的呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think folks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.40,0:55:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为拿就是一个"是"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that's a yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.66,0:55:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是真正的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was really something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.21,0:55:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯特尼斯 很有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Katniss, that was something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.94,0:56:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向你表示感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.56,0:56:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有一个问题问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have one more question for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.25,0:56:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是关于你妹妹的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about your sister...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.54,0:56:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都非常感动 我觉得…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are all very moved, I think when...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.41,0:56:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当你志愿代替她当贡者斗士的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you volunteered for her at the Reaping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.97,0:56:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她过来向你道别了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does she come to say goodbye to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.62,0:56:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.10,0:56:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.37,0:56:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你对他说了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what did you say to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.53,0:56:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在最后？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.48,0:56:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉她 我会尽力取胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told her that I would try to win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.32,0:56:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我将尽力为她取胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I will try to win for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.64,0:56:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然你做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.28,0:56:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也将去努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And try you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.98,0:56:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们 先生们 来自12区的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen, from District 12,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.23,0:56:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯特尼斯·伊芙迪恩 燃烧的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Katniss Everdeen, The Girl On Fire!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.61,0:57:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做到了 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did it darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.79,0:57:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是不可思议的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.97,0:57:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.58,0:57:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干的好 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice job sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.62,0:57:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.84,0:57:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,服装也好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice dress too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.44,0:57:13.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.30,0:57:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮塔 迈拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peeta Mellark!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.42,0:57:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮塔 欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peeta, welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.84,0:57:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么找到国会的？不要说是看地图找到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you finding the Capitol? Don't say with a map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.80,0:57:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 那是不同的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, it's uh...different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.30,0:57:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是非常不同的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.54,0:57:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么不同？是在哪？给我们一个例子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Different? In what are? Give us an example.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.40,0:57:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 好吧 这里的淋浴室非常古怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh okay, well the showers here are weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.17,0:57:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,淋浴室？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Showers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.93,0:57:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.73,0:57:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有不同的淋浴室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have different showers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.01,0:57:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有一个问题问你 凯撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a question for you Caesar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.73,0:57:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我闻起来像玫瑰吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I smell like roses to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.79,0:57:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.23,0:57:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.00,0:57:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.80,0:57:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我闻起来像吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I smell like it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.43,0:57:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定闻起来比我的更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You definitely smell better than I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.82,0:58:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我住在这里的时间比你长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I live here longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.79,0:58:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以皮塔…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Peeta...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.79,0:58:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.26,0:58:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有一个特殊的女孩回家？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a special girl back home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.78,0:58:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 真的没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not really.{\r}
