Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.79,0:59:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不跟我说话 你说你对我有好感吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't talk to me and you say you have a crush on me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.94,0:59:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你想单独训练 那就是你想怎么玩吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say you wanna train alone...is that how you wanna play?{\r}
