Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.14,0:59:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 我可以出售12区的牛郎织女了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I can sell the star cross lovers from District 12.{\r}
