Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.63,1:01:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的意思是你不会杀死任何人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean you won't kill anyone?{\r}
