Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.16,1:11:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听到了熟悉的大炮声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's the familiar boom of the cannon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.25,1:11:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这标志着又一个贡者斗士倒下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which marks the end of another fallen Tribute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.70,1:15:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 在前8个小时已经倒下13个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that maes 13 gone in the first eight hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.20,1:15:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳狄斯 我想我看到了一结盟正在组成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Claudius, I think I seen alliance forming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.74,1:15:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请不要杀我 噢 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't kill me. Oh no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.76,1:15:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 小白脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, loverboy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.16,1:15:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定她是从这条路走的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure she went this way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.82,1:15:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我敢肯定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.87,1:15:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.51,1:15:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 那里有个梳子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. That was a steer comb back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.98,1:15:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定我们现在不应该杀死他吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure we shouldn't just kill him now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.99,1:15:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,通过他 我们很容易找到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah. He's our best chance at finding her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.45,1:16:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.58,1:16:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她几乎到边界了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is almost at the edge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.21,1:16:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,距离最近的贡者斗士也有2公里远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two kilometers away from the nearest Tribute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.94,1:16:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,转到她的周围看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's turn her around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.82,1:17:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用我的账户干掉另一个人…一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killing another on my account...one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.53,1:17:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.65,1:17:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 她奔向左翼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, she's heading towards the left flank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.98,1:17:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.70,1:17:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.74,1:18:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.98,1:18:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,露西亚 准备大炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucia, get a cannon ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.13,1:18:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 她在那里 她在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh there she is. There she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.22,1:19:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么 宝贝？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you got baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.54,1:20:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀掉她 卡托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill her Cato!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.72,1:20:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来抓你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming for you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.89,1:20:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我自己就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.33,1:20:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.13,1:20:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.24,1:20:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你应该用你的飞剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you should throw the sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.12,1:20:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们等她出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just wait her out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.30,1:20:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他总会下来的 到那时再杀她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gonna come down at some points. That's gonne start her there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.47,1:20:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.73,1:21:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找人点火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody make a fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.10,1:23:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.62,1:25:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳迪斯 我认为那些是追踪黄蜂 我错了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claudius. I think those are trackerjackers. Am I wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.22,1:25:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ho...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.82,1:25:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些东西都是非常致命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those things are very lethal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.92,1:25:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.91,1:25:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些东西是你们不知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For those of you who don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.12,1:25:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,追踪黄蜂是转基因后的黄蜂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trackerjackers are genetically engineered wasps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.37,1:25:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其毒液会产生剧痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whose venom causes serious pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.69,1:25:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,强大的幻觉甚至会导致死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Powerful hallucinations and in extreme cases, death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.81,1:28:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.72,1:28:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.51,1:28:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.69,1:28:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.68,1:28:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯特尼斯 没有 你在干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Katniss, no! What're you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.16,1:28:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.30,1:28:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叮咬即使不致命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hallow isn't lethal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.12,1:28:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但一只追踪黄蜂刺上的毒液…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the venom of a trackerjacker sting...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.59,1:28:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是足以产生想睡觉的幻觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is enough to doze off hallucinations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.64,1:30:00.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请做一些事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please do something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.16,1:30:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯特尼斯 去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Katniss, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.17,1:30:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离开这里 你在干什么？去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here! What're you doing? Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.91,1:31:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芸香？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.61,1:31:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 我不会伤害你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. I'm not gonna hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.71,1:31:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想吃我的这个吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want mine too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.38,1:31:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.04,1:31:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿着吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.89,1:31:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.11,1:31:47.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多久 我睡着了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long was I asleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.33,1:31:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,2天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A couple of days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.49,1:31:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你换了两次树叶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I change your leaves twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.15,1:31:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.95,1:31:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我不在的时候 都发生了什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what happened? When I was out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.19,1:32:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1区的女孩和10区的男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girl from 1 and the boy from 10.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.65,1:32:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.79,1:32:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和我这个区的男孩吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the boy from my district?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.06,1:32:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 他没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.65,1:32:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为他掉到河里面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he's down by the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.72,1:32:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是真实的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is all about true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.65,1:32:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.38,1:32:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.25,1:32:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 卡托和其他人呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So where are Cato and the others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.36,1:32:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在湖边得到了供给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got all their supplies down by the lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.09,1:32:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都在这个大金字塔形堆里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's prod up in this great big pyramid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.00,1:32:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这听起来很诱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sounds tempting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.55,1:32:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 这个绿色的东西会疯狂的冒烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now this green stuff is gonna smoke like crazy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.03,1:32:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你一点着它 就马上点下一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so as soon as you light it. Move on to the next fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.56,1:32:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后再点燃这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Light this one last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.03,1:32:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会回到这和你会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll meet you back over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.49,1:32:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.76,1:33:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当他们追我们时 我会毁掉他们的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll destroy their stuff while they're chasing us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.98,1:33:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要个暗号 以防我们中的一个被抓走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a signal, in case one of us gets held up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.44,1:33:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 是什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Like what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.85,1:33:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里 看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Watch this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.22,1:33:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,学舌鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mocking jays.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.42,1:33:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.23,1:33:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在家里 我们就用它们当暗号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back home, we used them to signal all the time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.90,1:33:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.55,1:33:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 如果我们听到那个 就意味着我们没事而且很快就会回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay so, if we hear that means we're okay and we'll be back real soon.{\r}
