Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.77,1:52:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我没有把它…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I don't even make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.13,1:52:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贡者斗士们 请注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention Tributes. Attention!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.63,1:52:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黎明时开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commencing Insuberance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.46,1:52:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明天将在聚宝盆举行盛宴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will be a feast tomorrow at the Curnocopia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.76,1:52:26.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这将是极不平凡的盛会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will be no ordinary occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.49,1:52:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们每个人都需要一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each of you needs something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.67,1:52:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拼命地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Desperately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.54,1:52:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们计划是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we planned to be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.16,1:52:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大方的东道主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}generous hosts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.71,1:52:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是坐着吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You rather sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.45,1:52:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们需要的 但是你不能走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That we needed and you can't walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.56,1:52:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,答应我 你不要因为我而去冒生命的危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Promise me, you'll not gonna risk your life for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.94,1:52:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让你这么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna let you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.54,1:52:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会为我这么做吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would do it for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.62,1:52:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.44,1:52:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要这样做呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.94,1:53:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peeta!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.04,1:53:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.03,1:53:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.32,1:53:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.62,1:53:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.01,1:55:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.77,1:55:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小白脸在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's lover boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.52,1:55:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.54,1:55:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要帮助他 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna help him right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.96,1:55:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是甜蜜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.39,1:55:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 这太糟糕了 你不能帮助你的小朋友了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, it's too bad you couldn't help your little friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.09,1:55:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个小女孩…她叫什么名字？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That little girl...what was her name again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.47,1:55:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芸香？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.78,1:55:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我们杀了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Well we killed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.79,1:55:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.71,1:55:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会杀了你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna kill you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.97,1:55:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了她吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kill her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.26,1:56:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.69,1:56:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cato!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.75,1:56:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喊她的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shout her name!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.15,1:56:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有这一次 十二区的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just this time twelve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.79,1:56:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了芸香\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Rue!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.74,1:56:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peeta!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.17,1:56:36.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我拿到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.52,1:56:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我拿到药了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got the medicine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.98,1:56:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.38,1:56:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我不是 发生了什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not. What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.20,1:56:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,2区的女孩 她刺了一刀 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girl from two, she threw a knife. I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.31,1:56:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不应该去 你说过你不会去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't have gone. You said you aren't gonna go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.26,1:56:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你病得严重了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.46,1:56:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也用一些这个药吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get some of that too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.43,1:56:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.57,1:57:00.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That feels better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.79,1:57:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.93,1:57:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.44,1:57:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我挺好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.19,1:57:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 来吧 你也需要它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, come on. You need it too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.28,1:57:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.71,1:58:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.29,1:58:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so much better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.22,1:58:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 我的上帝 皮塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God, Peeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.76,1:58:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我什么也感觉不到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't feel anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.86,1:58:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.60,1:58:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:35.62,1:58:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道 起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know, took off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.59,1:58:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是会待在聚宝盆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right in the mouth of the Cornocopia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.51,1:58:41.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是不会去他不知道的地方的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not gonna go to places he doesn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.62,1:58:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狐狸脸 她可能在任何地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox face, she could be anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.66,1:58:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该在这里打猎 我们没有食物了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should probably hunt around here. We don't have any food left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.90,1:58:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 嗯 我会拿弓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, uh, I'll take the bow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.89,1:58:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.46,1:59:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮塔？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peeta?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.89,1:59:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮塔？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peeta?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.32,1:59:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮塔？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peeta?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.54,1:59:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮塔？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peeta?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.76,1:59:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.84,1:59:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听到了炮声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear the cannon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.77,1:59:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是有毒植物 皮塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's nightlock Peeta!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.54,1:59:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一分钟前差点死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will be dead in a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.18,1:59:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我…我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...I didn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.41,1:59:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你吓死我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You scare me to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.88,1:59:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.17,1:59:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.45,1:59:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.67,1:59:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至不知道 她在跟着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even knew, she was following me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.18,1:59:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她很聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's clever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.89,1:59:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太聪明了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too clever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.58,1:59:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.76,2:00:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许卡托也喜欢浆果？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe Cato likes berries too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.46,2:00:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几点了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.11,2:00:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下午吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.60,2:00:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这么黑？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is it so dark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.01,2:00:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,必须尽快结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must be in a hurry to end it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.97,2:00:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了 露西亚？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready Lusia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.85,2:00:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 在这呢 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh right here sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.95,2:00:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.02,2:00:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能把那个放到中间吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you put that in the middle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.36,2:00:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.80,2:00:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.30,2:00:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.16,2:00:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.14,2:01:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.27,2:01:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它是终曲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the finale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.51,2:01:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.12,2:03:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.02,2:04:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.13,2:04:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放箭呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.17,2:04:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我俩都掉下去 你就赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we both go down and you'd win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:00.82,2:05:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.77,2:05:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反正是死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.14,2:05:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我总是想喝酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always want a drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.35,2:05:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在到不想了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until not so now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.76,2:05:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是如何形成的呢？这就是你想要的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's that? Is that what you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.49,2:05:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呵呵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.25,2:05:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.56,2:05:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我仍然可以做到这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can still do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.76,2:05:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我仍然可以做到这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can still do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.60,2:05:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多杀一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.54,2:05:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我唯一知道该怎么做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only thing I know how to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.40,2:05:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我们区带来骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring pride to the district.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.49,2:05:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that it matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.45,2:06:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.13,2:07:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请注意 贡者斗士们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention. Attention Tributes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.74,2:07:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,规则有一点变化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There has been a slight rule change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.27,2:07:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以前的那个允许来自同一地区有两个胜利者的条款已被废除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The previous provision allowing for two victors from the same district has been revoked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.61,2:07:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个胜利者允许加冕 祝好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only one victor maybe crowned. Goodluck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.09,2:07:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好运永远属于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And may the odds be ever in your favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.93,2:07:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.06,2:07:48.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们每个人都应该回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of us should go home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.92,2:07:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们中的一个必须死 他们一定要有他们的胜利者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of us has to die. They had to have their victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.20,2:07:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.31,2:07:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不是这样做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.53,2:08:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么要呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.97,2:08:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.81,2:08:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.49,2:08:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.79,2:08:26.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一起吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.66,2:08:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:30.15,2:08:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.26,2:08:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.81,2:08:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,二…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.14,2:08:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.09,2:08:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.11,2:08:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.73,2:08:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.95,2:08:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来介绍…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I present the winners...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.20,2:09:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第74届饥饿游戏的胜利者…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the 74th Annual Hunger Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.83,2:09:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不喜欢和你在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not happy with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.56,2:09:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么呢？因为我们没死吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? Because we didn't die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.42,2:09:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你把他们看透了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you showed them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.68,2:09:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:35.74,2:09:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起我没按照他们计划的那样去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry it didn't go the way they planned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.44,2:09:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我也不是很喜欢和他们在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I'm not very happy with them either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.17,2:09:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯特尼斯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Katniss...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.56,2:09:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是认真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.39,2:09:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不只是为你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not just for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.82,2:09:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不採取这样的事情掉以轻心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't take this things lightly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.87,2:10:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你情不自禁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say you couldn't help yourself.You're so in love{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.36,2:10:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是如此的爱这个男孩以至于黑暗都无法用最…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with this boy that the dark have not with the most...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:45.89,2:10:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可思议啊…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unthinkable...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:47.62,2:10:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果不能和他在一起 你宁可死… 你明白吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You rather die...than not be with him you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:51.76,2:10:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么感觉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:53.50,2:10:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当你在河边发现他的时候？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you found him by the river?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.88,2:11:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我是世界上最幸福的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I felt like the happiest person in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:07.54,2:11:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法想像没有他的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't imagine life without him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.04,2:11:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮塔 你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what about you Peeta?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.13,2:11:20.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的 她只是救了我的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, she just saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:20.94,2:11:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们拯救了对方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We saved each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.82,2:11:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:25.66,2:11:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,12区的明星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The star cross lovers of District 12, this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:30.00,2:11:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今年第74届饥饿游戏的胜利者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}years victors of the 74th Annual Hunger Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:50.81,2:11:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝贺你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.41,2:11:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:59.27,2:12:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个多么可爱的胸针\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a lovely pin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:01.02,2:12:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 这是来自我的区的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, it's from my district.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:04.31,2:12:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们一定会为你感到骄傲的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must be very proud of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:19.21,2:12:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们回去后会发生什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what happens when we get back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:22.99,2:12:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:25.43,2:12:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我会努力忘记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I may try to forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:31.84,2:12:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想忘记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna forget.{\r}
